## Brief Summary

**Objective:** Implement Week 6 Dev B across story-dialogue (StoryManager, flags, DialogueBox), town (NPCs, Alchemist, Map Room), run-economy (Shop/Rest polish, currency scaling), and art-audio (8 NPC sheets + 8 portraits + 4 UI states) in one branch `feat/week6-dev-b-story-town-art` off `main`. All GUT tests, art build check, and two-instance smoke test must pass before opening one PR with auto-fix enabled (never merged).

**In scope:** W6-B1 (condition language, flags, schema validation), W6-B2 (DialogueBox UI mockup, LorePage, codex stub), W6-B3 (Act 1 JSON content), W6-B4 (town NPCs, Alchemist menu, Map Room, building sprites), W6-B5 (Shop/Rest polish, currency scaling), W6-B6 (8 NPC walk/idle, 8 portraits, UI theme, art review sheets). Content is data (JSON dialogue, lore); no new systems. Strict static typing, named GUT callbacks, host-authoritative sync, tests ship with code.

**Success:** `godot --headless --path . -s addons/gut/gut_cmdln.gd -gdir=res://tests -ginclude_subdirs -gexit` (0), `python build_all.py --check` (0), `tools/smoke_two.sh` (0), one PR with all commits reviewable.

**Removed:** W6-B2 UI approval gate (mockup sign-off replaces "wait for yes"), W6-B6 approval gate (review sheet only, not marked approved in INDEX), per-task status updates (automatic LOG.md logging replaces them), all interactive pauses.

